  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Times News Network\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                                Times News Network\n                                                                \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Sep 25, 2026 at 07:44 AM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p><a href=\"/tag/madurai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Madurai</a>: <a href=\"/tag/tamil+nadu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tamil Nadu</a> has intensified precautionary and <a href=\"/tag/vector-control+measures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vector-control measures</a> across the state following a rise in seasonal infectious diseases, with 17,939 confirmed <a href=\"/tag/dengue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">dengue</a> cases and nine deaths reported till Sept 23.Health and family welfare department principal secretary <a href=\"/tag/dr+darez+ahamed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dr Darez Ahamed</a> disclosed the figures after inspecting Simmakkal and chairing a review meeting in Madurai on Thursday.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Madurai district has reported 288 dengue cases so far, including 105 in the municipal corporation, 11 in municipalities, nine in town panchayats and 163 in rural village panchayat areas. High-incidence pockets have been mapped for targeted interventions.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>A total of 26,303 <a href=\"/tag/domestic+breeding+checkers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Domestic Breeding Checkers</a> (DBC) have been deployed across the state, including 1,637 in Madurai district. Regular <a href=\"/tag/larvicide+application\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">larvicide application</a> and indoor fogging are also being carried out.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>“Medical facilities have been placed on high alert. Thirty-eight <a href=\"/tag/district+rapid+response+teams\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">District Rapid Response Teams</a> (RRT), 388 Block Teams statewide and 19 Block RRTs in Madurai are ready for immediate deployment in hotspot zones, alongside coordinated inter-departmental action,” Dr Ahamed said.He said Special Newborn Care Units (SNCU) in government hospitals across the state were fully operational, with uninterrupted stocks of critical drugs and paediatric fluid therapy supplies to handle any surge in cases during the monsoon.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>Madurai district collector <a href=\"/tag/nishant+krishna\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Nishant Krishna</a>, corporation commissioner Gaurav Kumar and other senior officials accompanied Dr Ahamed.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Times News Network</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Times News Network</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/87654367/TNN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TNN</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Sep 25, 2026 at 07:44 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Sep 25, 2026 at 07:44 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                                            <!-- <div class=\"app-store-container desktop-view\">\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"Play Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\"